<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.48		 41.53</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	69.00		 69.10</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.95		 24.00</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.363		 0.365</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.04		 11.06</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.29		 11.32</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.50 pct	    2.70 pct</p>
